Note on distributed binaries: the wasm/JAR bundles produced by this repository
statically include upstream PDF/diff libraries (poppler, pdfium, MuPDF, cairo,
PDFBox, Ghostscript, Xpdf, butteraugli, dssim, FLIP). Each of those
bundles is governed by the license of the upstream it includes — see the
license table in README.md. Switching this repository's own source to MIT
does not change the licenses of the produced binaries.
